      "reason": "OMZ thickness and volume calculations require volcello, areacello and deptho, and this fragment defines volcello/areacello and the recovery of layer thickness as volcello/areacello.",
      "status": "dropped",
      "notes": [
        "OMZ thickness: layer thickness = `volcello`/`areacello` (`cell_thickness_like`), not `lev_bnds` differences — partial bottom cells differ by up to ±50 % (MPI) and 14 % of GFDL cells by >1 %; `thkcello`/`masscello` are absent.",
        "Judge \"above the model sea floor\" with `deptho` or the field's own fill pattern, not external topography."
      ]
