      "reason": "The data are monthly means, and OMZ volume below a threshold is a nonlinear diagnostic whose value computed offline from monthly means differs from the mean of the diagnostic, so this caveat must be stated.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Monthly means are time averages, so f(monthly mean) ≠ mean of f for the threshold, thickness and AOU steps; state whether the diagnostic was formed before or after averaging (average-first is like-for-like against the WOA23 normal).",
        "Average a period with `temporal_aggregate` (day weights in the model calendar); a monthly climatology/normal is the plain mean of that calendar month across years, not day-weighted."
